{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Anterior Pelvic Tilt Exercise》是一款引導式健身應用，針對骨盆前傾而設，透過伸展與強化訓練改善姿勢、強化核心，並提升下肢穩定性、活動能力及柔軟度。無論你是初學者還是有經驗的用家，都可利用每日訓練計劃和逐步指示，輕鬆將運動融入日常生活。這款應用現正限時免費，原價 US $1.99。</p>\n\n<h2>重點功能</h2>\n<p>應用提供髖部、核心及下肢的引導式伸展與強化訓練，並備有每日姿勢與活動訓練計劃。每個動作均有逐步指示，確保安全有效；設有初階、中階及進階程度，適合不同經驗人士。毋須器材，可隨時隨地完成簡短訓練，搭配簡潔易用的介面，讓你更輕鬆維持每日運動習慣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-94-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-95-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-96-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-97-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2064x2752bb-41-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2064x2752bb-42-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Anterior Pelvic Tilt Exercise</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T19:58:50.351214+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":353,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}